      "writtenOn": "2023-11-01T03:14:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Check FLAG_SYSTEM instead. Given that isPrivilegedApp is U API.\nAnd we might want to keep T compatibility.\nNetworkStack is:\n    flags\u003d[ SYSTEM HAS_CODE PERSISTENT ALLOW_CLEAR_USER_DATA ALLOW_BACKUP ]\n    privateFlags\u003d[ PRIVATE_FLAG_ACTIVITIES_RESIZE_MODE_RESIZEABLE_VIA_SDK_VERSION ALLOW_AUDIO_PLAYBACK_CAPTURE DEFAULT_TO_DEVICE_PROTECTED_STORAGE DIRECT_BOOT_AWARE PRIVILEGED PRIVATE_FLAG_ALLOW_NATIVE_HEAP_POINTER_TAGGING ]\n    \nSee if it works for you.\nAlternatively, we might want to check android permissions but it is still bypassable IIUC.",
